Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.29,0:21:20.22,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.47,0:21:21.93,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}好想被愛
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.93,0:21:28.31,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.77,0:21:32.02,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.02,0:21:34.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.82,0:21:37.78,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.78,0:21:40.07,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.20,0:21:43.28,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}沒有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.28,0:21:45.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.83,0:21:48.70,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.70,0:21:51.21,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.21,0:21:54.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將自己的名字刻在心裡
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.33,0:21:58.38,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.55,0:22:04.64,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}留在過去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.18,0:22:10.98,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.98,0:22:13.31,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.31,0:22:16.44,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.44,0:22:22.40,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs55}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.53,0:22:26.53,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs55}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.24,0:22:29.58,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.50,0:22:40.26,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.29,0:21:20.22,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.47,0:21:21.93,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.93,0:21:28.31,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.77,0:21:32.02,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.02,0:21:34.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.82,0:21:37.78,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.78,0:21:40.07,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.20,0:21:43.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.28,0:21:45.83,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.83,0:21:48.70,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.70,0:21:51.21,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.21,0:21:54.33,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.33,0:21:58.38,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.55,0:22:04.64,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.18,0:22:10.98,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.98,0:22:13.31,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.31,0:22:16.44,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.44,0:22:22.40,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.53,0:22:26.53,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.24,0:22:29.58,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.50,0:22:40.26,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:20.22,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:21.93,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}好想被愛
